                <div class="card p-5 border-l-4 border-emerald-400">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
                        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">1</span>
                        <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white">Restaurants Post Surplus Food</h4>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed pl-11">
                        Commercial eateries list prepared meals, item quantity, expiry hours, and pickup instructions with just a few clicks.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Step 2 -->
                <div class="card p-5 border-l-4 border-blue-400">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
                        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">2</span>
                        <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white">Charities Claim in Real-Time</h4>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed pl-11">
                        Registered charities browse live listings, claim donations instantly, and coordinate directly for pickup.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Step 3 -->
                <div class="card p-5 border-l-4 border-purple-400">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
                        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-purple-500/20 text-purple-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">3</span>
                        <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white">Admin Trust & Hygiene Gate</h4>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed pl-11">
                        Every restaurant and charity is manually reviewed and approved by the system admin to guarantee safety.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Step 4 -->
                <div class="card p-5 border-l-4 border-amber-400">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
                        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">4</span>
                        <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white">AI Guidance in Urdu</h4>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed pl-11">
                        MealBot guides users in Roman Urdu and English on how to donate, claim, and maintain food safety protocols.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
